    "4abe1d6c-9397-4105-82a8-58845f7c8b67": {
      "type": "component__reviews-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "9823ddb2-0cab-4837-af6b-70e69e6078c5": {
          "type": "review",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Great gift for a tea lover. Gave to a friend for her birthday. She loved every one!<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Dana W",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "premium-sachet-collection"
          }
        },
        "review_AwkCUW": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Each sachet has the highest quality tea leaves and the flavor is heavenly. I love a good cup of tea that doesn't taste watered down. The assortment was well chosen.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Robin T",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "premium-sachet-collection"
          }
        },
        "review_PiJCDC": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>This is an exceptional set for the price. Beautifully packaged and consisting of very high quality tea ware. This would make an especially lovely gift for someone just learning the tea ceremony or getting into Japanese tea ritual. The illustrated guide included in the set is a nice touch.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Heidi D",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "ceremonial-matcha-kit"
          }
        },
        "review_VyJwzd": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Incredible packaging, very luxurious and the tea selection is amazing and delicious.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Kelsey S",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "premium-loose-leaf-tea-collection"
          }
        },
        "review_CccACh": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Rishi's Earl Grey Supreme tea is amazing. My daughter is a devoted Rishi Tea lover and she encouraged me to try the Earl Grey Supreme blend. She gifted me the sampler and I have become a true believer in the flavor and freshness of Rishi Tea.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Barbara S",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-earl-grey-supreme-black-tea"
          }
        },
        "review_aXenHk": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>This is the most incredible chai tea I've had in my life, and I can't get enough of its flavor. You taste every ingredient that's listed. Grateful to have found this tea after hearing a recommendation!<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Mumtaj C",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-masala-chai-black-tea"
          }
        },
        "review_VRArH9": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>LOVE my loose leaf teapot—it now is one of my favorite pieces in my kitchen!! It makes me want to drink tea all day and enjoy fresh loose tea even more! We purchased three more for my family and gifts.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Natalie G",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "simple-brew-glass-teapot"
          }
        },
        "review_xzYQeU": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Talk about fresh—this tea is still on the stems! Delightful, fragrant, beautiful color. Velvet on the tongue. Packaging made me feel like I'd given myself a special gift. Lovely.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Eileen L",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "greek-mountain-tea-malotiras"
          }
        },
        "review_fMzGQh": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>I am just getting into matcha and this was so good! Perfect blend of umami and sweetness, and a lovely bright green color. Would repurchase.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Evelyn S",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-ceremonial-matcha-tin"
          }
        },
        "f7b12b6c-ef4e-4cac-a879-212ef96312ce": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>My wife's favorite tea of all time. We ordered the biggest bag possible of it. She might stop drinking coffee she likes it so much.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Aaron J",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-cinnamon-plum-herbal-tea"
          }
        },
        "review_XByQnc": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Really nicely packaged. The ceramic bowl has a nice finish to it and the matcha tastes delicious. Nice little instruction manual as well. Would make a great gift.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "John M",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "ceremonial-matcha-kit"
          }
        },
        "review_Ty76jF": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>So glad I got this set. I was able to try teas I haven’t had before. Delicious. I love the teapot too. Highly recommended.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Nancy W",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "black-tea-gift-set"
          }
        },
        "92c6a217-18e1-4417-851c-e8aeded031e8": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Easily the richest pumpkin spice blend I've ever tasted. It's bursting with flavor but incredibly well balanced, earthy, spicy, and cinnamon sweet. Delicious!<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Kristy K",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-pumpkin-spice-tea-qp"
          }
        },
        "review_i4FapM": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Love this tart tea! The schisandra berries give it such a bright, tangy flavor that's refreshing and unique. Perfect hot or iced. It's my new favorite pick-me-up.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Lauren Z",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-schisandra-berry-herbal-tea"
          }
        },
        "1357833e-3c21-4db3-8cb4-d3c5d9ef26af": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>The tea is wonderful—very soothing and aromatic. Initially its effects were extremely healing as it helped me sleep and find solace in deep sense of grief. It also made aches and inflammation of my body better—this tea could be a peace treaty.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Jessica G",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "blue-jasmine-green-tea"
          }
        },
        "9dd1fcdc-e83e-4a20-90ae-0e11696ddbae": {
          "type": "review",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>Order While You Can - It's Seasonal! A soothing evening drink without worry about caffeine. Full of flavor and its as if you're drinking a minty cocoa.<\/p>",
            "attribution": "Gwen I",
            "rating": "5",
            "product": "organic-cocoa-mint-herbal-tea"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "9823ddb2-0cab-4837-af6b-70e69e6078c5",
        "review_AwkCUW",
        "review_PiJCDC",
