    "faq_global_XcEHM7": {
      "type": "faq-global",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_TJFJbU": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are good holiday teas for people who don’t typically drink tea?",
            "answer": "<p>For those who aren’t yet regular tea drinkers, we recommend starting with approachable, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/collections\/caffeine-free\">caffeine-free<\/a> blends or our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/premium-sachet-collection\">Premium Sachet Collection<\/a>, which offers a convenient way to sample a variety of flavors and find new favorites. For easy at-home, cafe-quality lattes, give the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/concentrate-variety-pack\">Concentrate Sampler Pack<\/a> or our craft-brewed <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/collections\/sparkling-botanicals\">Sparkling Botanicals<\/a>—ready-to-enjoy options with no brewing required.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_qKWT3e": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the best gift for someone who loves green tea?",
            "answer": "<p>Green tea enthusiasts will love the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/green-tea-gift-set\">Green Tea Gift Set<\/a>, which pairs a Fluted Simple Brew glass teapot with four premium green teas from Japan and China or our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/japanese-green-tea-starter-bundle\">Japanese Green Tea Starter Bundle<\/a>, which pairs a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/hario-chacha-zen-kyusu-teapot\">Hario ChaCha \"Zen\" Kyusu Teapot<\/a> with a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/tea-cooling-pitcher\">Tokoname Yuzamashi Black Cooling Pitcher<\/a> and two premium green teas from Japan. For those who prefer the meditative ritual of matcha, the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/ceremonial-matcha-kit\">Ceremonial Matcha Set<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/teahouse-matcha-starter-bundle\">Teahouse Matcha Starter Bundle<\/a> make thoughtful gifts, honoring centuries of tradition.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_yqr6eP": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the best tea gift ideas for someone who loves coffee?",
            "answer": "<p>If you’re shopping for a coffee drinker, consider gifting bold, full-bodied black teas, which naturally offer the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/collections\/high-caffeine\">most caffeine<\/a> among tea varieties. The <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/black-tea-gift-set\">Black Tea Gift Set<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/earl-grey-supreme-simple-brew-set\">Earl Grey Supreme & Simple Brew Set<\/a> or <a href=\"http:\/\/rishi-tea.com\/products\/breakfast-flight-of-tea-bundle\">Breakfast Flight of Tea Bundle<\/a> each provide a robust experience that coffee lovers will appreciate. Also feel free to check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/collections\/tea-for-coffee-lovers\">Teas for Coffee Lovers<\/a> collection for inspiration. from our holiday tea collection. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_MK6Wmb": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the best gift for someone who is new to tea?",
            "answer": "<p>For beginners, choose teas that are easy to brew and showcase a range of flavors. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/rishi-tea.com\/products\/premium-sachet-collection\">Premium Sachet Collection<\/a> is an effortless way to explore premium teas. For those curious about loose leaf, the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/premium-loose-leaf-tea-collection\">Premium Loose Leaf Tea Collection<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rishi-tea.com\/products\/loose-leaf-tea-favorites-gift-set\">Loose Leaf Tea Favorites Gift Set<\/a> introduce them to the art of brewing with quality teas and teaware selections. <\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
